      "agentType": "general-purpose"
    }
  ],
  "legal": "Character names are protected IP, and so is a film’s visual identity. Palettes here are hand-picked colours in the spirit of each film’s grade, and looks are five-colour recolours of a generic sprite — not artwork, not likenesses. Fine for a personal or internal tool; not for anything shipped publicly.",
